    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The patch notes say v2.0 is moving to a more streamlined, generalized navigation framework to save on compute overhead. It's basically stripping out the auxiliary heuristic caches from the last three years to make room for the new core. Does that change anything regarding your assessment of the trajectory calculations?",
